# GitHub language stats (Linguist).
#
# ExifTool is a third-party tool committed into this bundle so the "edit
# originals" feature works without the user installing anything. It's ~460 Perl
# modules — without this, GitHub reports the repo as 99% Perl.
server/tools/exiftool_files/** linguist-vendored
server/tools/exiftool_files/** -linguist-detectable
